    "title": "Colorado flash flooding causes evacuations, closes U.S. 550, Red Mountain Pass",
    "text": "Ouray County officials ordered evacuations near the Gold Mountain burn scar on Wednesday evening as flash floods hit the area, closing U.S. 550 and Red Mountain Pass in both directions.\nPeople living near Ponderosa Village and Cutler Creek Drive between Ridgway and Ouray should evacuate if able to safely leave home, or climb to high ground, because of “active intense flooding,” county officials said.",
